        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Fade to Black, Flashback: The Quest for Identity\n- Companies: Delphine Software International, Delphine Software, Electronic Arts, U.S. Gold, Sunsoft\n- Concepts: action-adventure games, science fiction cinematic platform games\n\nFacts:\n- In 1992, Flashback was released as a science fiction cinematic platform game.\n- In the United States, Flashback was released under the title Flashback: The Quest for Identity.\n- Delphine Software of France developed Flashback.\n- U.S. Gold published Flashback in the United States and Europe.\n- Sunsoft published Flashback in Japan.\n- Fade to Black is an action-adventure game.\n- Delphine Software International developed Fade to Black.\n- Electronic Arts published Fade to Black.",
